file_name": "cover.png", "id": "851768561083504", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_851768564416837_8186888883591940137_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hyrZcUrARjgQ7kNvwH2vvXA&_nc_oc=AdoTJpJ-gOk4cqKHcOMSNGHkO7TLP0PlgqF_JCyNQKuU-LPP6lfoCU8yMYcs0-63RxQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af98oDdEaROIreY-PzfsYcNdOGABnDj66Ev-tpraosfKLg&oe=6A22D683"}, "display_name": "Ape Maps", "keywords": ["Finance", "Visualization", "Stocks", "Chart", "Heatmap"], "long_description": "# A Next-Gen Financial App for Meta Quest\n\n**Overview**\n\nApe Maps is a next-generation financial visualization tool built specifically for Meta Quest headsets. It brings the power of professional-grade charting and market analysis into an immersive 3D environment, enabling traders, analysts, and finance enthusiasts to explore markets in new ways.\n\n\n**Key Features**\n\n1.**Immersive 3D Charts**\n\nInteractive bar, and line charts displayed in three-dimensional space.\n rotate, and scale graphs with hand gestures for a highly intuitive experience.\nReal-time price data streaming with customizable timeframes.\n\n2.**Advanced Analytics**\n\nMultiple chart layouts for monitoring different assets simultaneously.\nHeatmaps and volumetric visualizations for instant trend recognition.\n\n3.**VR-Optimized Interface**\n\nCustomizable workspaces that let users build their own \u201cfinancial cockpit.\u201d\n\n\n4.**Integration & Functionality**\n\nEconomic calendar and news feed integrated directly into the VR dashboard.\nCloud synchronization ensures your setups are accessible across devices.\n\n**Performance**\n\nThe app runs smoothly on Meta Quest hardware, with minimal latency in chart rendering. The 3D environment enhances focus by eliminating external distractions, while the UI is optimized for long trading sessions without causing VR fatigue.\n\n**Pros**\n- Unique 3D visualization unavailable in tradition", "short_descript